From df0b3de9fbc18f29be52af3c3535898a2a5a9263 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:40:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD selected-agent slash command hook so provider
 commands bypass prompts

Selected chat messages that are slash commands route through a backend command API instead of the regular send path. Providers can implement command execution directly, while Codex resumes the existing thread with the raw command text.
